#: ../clips.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fade In and Out` → :guilabel:`Fast` / :guilabel:`Slow` — applies "
"both a fade-in at the start and a fade-out at the end."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Luntur Masuk dan Keluar` → :guilabel:`Cepat` / :guilabel:`Lambat`"
" — menerapkan luntur masuk di awal dan luntur keluar di akhir."

#: ../clips.rst:254
