msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Keluar` — animasi keluar diterapkan di akhir klip (mencerminkan "
"opsi Masuk: Kembali Keluar, Blur Keluar, Pantulan Keluar, Sapuan Fokus "
"Keluar, Muncul Keluar, Geser Keluar, Spiral Keluar, Sapuan Keluar)."

#: ../clips.rst:279
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Emphasis` — short attention-grabbing animations **inserted at the"
" current playhead position** (not applied across the whole clip). Useful for"
" mid-clip highlights: **Bounce**, **Flash**, **Heartbeat**, **Jello**, "
"**Pulse**, **Rubber Band**, **Shake X**, **Shake Y**, **Swing**, **Tada**, "
"**Wobble**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Penekanan` — animasi singkat yang menarik perhatian **disisipkan "
"pada posisi playhead saat ini** (tidak diterapkan di seluruh klip). Berguna "
"untuk sorotan tengah klip: **Bounce**, **Flash**, **Heartbeat**, **Jello**, "
"**Pulse**, **Rubber Band**, **Shake X**, **Shake Y**, **Swing**, **Tada**, "
"**Wobble**."

#: ../clips.rst:281
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Camera` — simulates camera movement on the clip by animating "
"scale and position:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kamera` — mensimulasikan gerakan kamera pada klip dengan "
"menganimasikan skala dan posisi:"

#: ../clips.rst:283
msgid "**Zoom** → In / Out — a simple push-in or pull-out."
msgstr ""
"**Zoom** → Masuk / Keluar — dorongan masuk atau tarikan keluar yang "
"sederhana."

#: ../clips.rst:284
msgid ""
"**Pan** → Auto Direction / Left to Right / Right to Left / Top to Bottom / "
"Bottom to Top — a lateral camera pan. *Auto Direction* picks the best "
"direction based on the clip's aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"**Pan** → Arah Otomatis / Kiri ke Kanan / Kanan ke Kiri / Atas ke Bawah / "
"Bawah ke Atas — pan kamera lateral. *Arah Otomatis* memilih arah terbaik "
"berdasarkan rasio aspek klip."

#: ../clips.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Zoom & Pan** → In or Out, with directional variants — combines a zoom with"
" a pan (Ken Burns style). *Auto Direction* picks the best direction based on"
" the clip's aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"**Zoom & Pan** → Masuk atau Keluar, dengan varian arah — menggabungkan zoom "
"dengan pan (gaya Ken Burns). *Arah Otomatis* memilih arah terbaik "
"berdasarkan rasio aspek klip."

#: ../clips.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Credits` — scrolling credit animations: **Scroll Up** and "
