#: ../clips.rst:419
msgid "**Focus** — sharpness adjustments:"
msgstr "**Fokus** — penyesuaian ketajaman:"

#: ../clips.rst:421
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sharpen` → **No Sharpen**, then: **Subtle**, **Medium**, "
"**Strong** — sharpens fine detail."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Penajaman` → **Tanpa Penajaman**, lalu: **Halus**, **Sedang**, "
