msgstr ""
"**Volume** — mengontrol tingkat audio klip. Lihat :ref:`clip_volume_ref` "
"keyframe."

#: ../clips.rst:449
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset Volume` — removes all volume keyframes, returning to full "
