#: ../clips.rst:557
msgid "**How timeline waveforms are scaled**"
msgstr "**Cara skala gelombang timeline**"

#: ../clips.rst:559
msgid ""
"Timeline waveforms are an editing aid: they help you find speech, beats, "
"silence, and transients, and compare the approximate levels of different "
"clips. New waveform data preserves the source's **absolute peak level**. "
"OpenShot does not enlarge every quiet file until its highest peak fills the "
"clip, so a quiet recording remains visibly quieter than a loud recording."
msgstr ""
"Gelombang timeline adalah alat bantu pengeditan: mereka membantu Anda "
"menemukan ucapan, ketukan, keheningan, dan transien, serta membandingkan "
"tingkat perkiraan dari berbagai klip. Data gelombang baru mempertahankan "
"**tingkat puncak absolut** sumber. OpenShot tidak memperbesar setiap file "
"yang sunyi sampai puncak tertingginya memenuhi klip, sehingga rekaman yang "
"sunyi tetap terlihat lebih pelan daripada rekaman yang keras."

#: ../clips.rst:564
msgid ""
"Pure linear amplitude is accurate but makes ordinary speech difficult to "
"see. OpenShot therefore applies a fixed, gentle square-root display curve. "
"This expands useful detail while preserving the order of levels: a louder "
"source always appears taller than a quieter source. The curve changes only "
"the drawing; it does not alter, normalize, or process the recorded audio."
msgstr ""
"Amplitudo linier murni akurat tetapi membuat ucapan biasa sulit dilihat. "
"Oleh karena itu, OpenShot menerapkan kurva tampilan akar kuadrat yang tetap "
"dan lembut. Ini memperluas detail yang berguna sambil mempertahankan urutan "
"tingkat: sumber yang lebih keras selalu tampak lebih tinggi daripada sumber "
"yang lebih pelan. Kurva hanya mengubah gambar; tidak mengubah, menormalkan, "
"atau memproses audio yang direkam."

#: ../clips.rst:569
msgid "Approximate waveform height for new clips"
msgstr "Perkiraan tinggi gelombang untuk klip baru"

