msgstr ""
"**Tips:** Gunakan visualisasi gelombang untuk menekankan ketukan musik atau "
"modulasi suara."

#: ../clips.rst:1075
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Waveform Mode` property controls the visualization style used"
" when :guilabel:`Waveform` is enabled. It uses the same choices as the "
